WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:02.670
Huh? What?

00:03.730 --> 00:05.600
- Hot spring?
- Yeah.

00:05.970 --> 00:08.270
We'll be going, so pack up.

00:09.540 --> 00:12.980
You mean the popular place for healing?

00:12.980 --> 00:15.640
Got to be prepared.

00:15.640 --> 00:17.210
Where trendy couples go

00:17.210 --> 00:21.950
and get massaged, trimmed, and brushed?

00:22.790 --> 00:24.620
That kind of hot spring?

00:26.090 --> 00:27.890
A safe return, ribbit.

00:28.460 --> 00:29.460
Just kidding.

00:29.460 --> 00:32.030
Oh, Keita. You're so funny.

00:37.770 --> 00:41.600
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:41.600 --> 00:44.840
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:44.840 --> 00:51.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

01:02.460 --> 01:08.260
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

01:09.000 --> 01:15.100
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

01:15.700 --> 01:21.680
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

01:22.410 --> 01:29.650
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

01:29.650 --> 01:34.320
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

01:34.320 --> 01:38.190
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

01:38.190 --> 01:41.530
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

01:41.530 --> 01:47.140
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

01:47.840 --> 01:51.610
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

01:51.610 --> 01:54.810
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

01:54.810 --> 02:00.920
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

02:02.050 --> 02:06.960
Digging at the Mixed Bath!

02:03.620 --> 02:06.220
"Digging at the Mixed Bath!"

02:14.200 --> 02:18.070
Tamasaka Station

02:15.360 --> 02:18.070
It kind of smells like farts.

02:19.770 --> 02:21.640
It's hot spring sulfur.

02:21.640 --> 02:23.070
You're right.

02:25.840 --> 02:27.780
Hot spring buns

02:38.620 --> 02:40.390
Hey, Yoko!

02:40.760 --> 02:42.930
Come on. What are you doing?

02:42.930 --> 02:45.390
Oh, nothing.

02:49.400 --> 02:50.870
Hotel Pantagruel

02:51.600 --> 02:54.270
What? Nobody's here?

03:00.440 --> 03:02.380
Mr. Keita Kawahira?

03:06.650 --> 03:07.420
Yes.

03:07.420 --> 03:08.950
We have been waiting for you.

03:08.950 --> 03:10.590
Thank you for waiting.

03:10.590 --> 03:13.420
Dancing crane room

03:15.560 --> 03:17.160
It's so huge.

03:22.800 --> 03:24.270
It's so fluffy.

03:25.000 --> 03:25.870
Oh, that's right.

03:28.670 --> 03:32.880
Oh no, my lord. How rude!

03:34.580 --> 03:36.580
Ouch.

03:38.150 --> 03:40.380
There is an elusive spirit.

03:40.380 --> 03:44.790
It makes holes just like this all over the hotel.

03:45.490 --> 03:46.960
Is it a mole demon?

03:46.960 --> 03:49.860
The guests that witnessed it said

03:49.860 --> 03:53.600
they saw a fast black lump digging the holes.

03:53.600 --> 03:55.100
Black lump?

03:55.760 --> 03:57.970
Is it the spirit of a bowling ball?

03:57.970 --> 04:00.570
At this rate, we will get a bad rep.

04:00.570 --> 04:03.340
It'll be harder for us to get guests.

04:03.340 --> 04:05.810
Mr. Kawahira, please exterminate it.

04:06.240 --> 04:08.380
Please.

04:09.110 --> 04:10.580
I understand.

04:10.580 --> 04:14.080
It is my duty to vanquish evils that harm humans.

04:15.550 --> 04:17.320
Uh, hey, don't...

04:19.990 --> 04:21.360
What do we do?

04:21.620 --> 04:24.590
We won't let anyone interfere.
Let's chase him out.

04:29.800 --> 04:32.430
- What?
- I can't overlook this.

04:32.430 --> 04:33.340
Overlook what?

04:33.340 --> 04:37.110
I came all this way to get massaged, trimmed, and brushed.

04:37.410 --> 04:38.540
This is supposed to be a date...

04:39.040 --> 04:42.080
Date? Listen here, Yoko.

04:42.650 --> 04:44.780
What? We're here for a job?

04:44.780 --> 04:48.550
Yup, it's a demon extermination request from Hake.

04:48.550 --> 04:50.850
We're in a financial crisis.

04:50.850 --> 04:54.060
We might get kicked out for not paying rent.

04:56.160 --> 05:00.100
This mission may be quite dangerous, but the pay is...

05:00.100 --> 05:01.330
High.

05:01.330 --> 05:03.800
Then, what about the massage?

05:04.970 --> 05:06.070
Massaged.

05:06.070 --> 05:07.300
The trimming?

05:08.600 --> 05:09.510
Trimmed.

05:09.510 --> 05:11.010
And the brushing?

05:11.540 --> 05:14.040
Brush my brushy parts.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.910
Absolutely none!

05:15.910 --> 05:19.580
No way! But I prepared this much!

05:25.120 --> 05:26.520
What are these?

05:26.960 --> 05:30.760
Items needed for dates.
It says so here.

05:36.130 --> 05:41.000
Geez, that Yoko just went off on a misunderstanding.

05:45.170 --> 05:48.010
That's Master Keita?

05:54.050 --> 05:57.120
It's free time until the enemy shows up.

06:00.290 --> 06:04.330
An open mixed bath.
A place to meet girls.

06:04.330 --> 06:07.630
And it's free time right now!

06:10.730 --> 06:12.530
Such a fine body.

06:12.530 --> 06:15.270
I must use my free time effectively.

06:15.940 --> 06:17.410
So somebody's here.

06:18.010 --> 06:19.510
Yes, I'm here.

06:23.780 --> 06:26.420
She's so defenseless.

06:26.420 --> 06:29.490
Has travel put her in a more open mood?

06:36.590 --> 06:39.090
Yoko?

06:39.930 --> 06:41.830
Keita got turned on by me!

06:41.830 --> 06:44.270
You idiot! You're wrong!

06:45.770 --> 06:46.940
Yoko, hide.

06:47.670 --> 06:48.900
Just do it.

06:54.240 --> 06:57.180
This really is nice...

06:57.780 --> 07:00.650
Excuse me... Huh?

07:00.650 --> 07:02.920
Nadeshiko!

07:02.920 --> 07:04.150
Master Keita?

07:04.150 --> 07:05.890
Hi, Master Keita.

07:06.320 --> 07:07.420
The pervert's here.

07:07.420 --> 07:10.060
That's right, I'm a pervert.

07:10.060 --> 07:12.430
No, this is a mixed bath.

07:15.430 --> 07:16.770
Keita!

07:20.470 --> 07:22.670
This is a mixed bath.

07:22.670 --> 07:25.270
So why the poor treatment?

07:25.270 --> 07:27.440
Yoko. Let me go!

07:27.440 --> 07:29.610
Umm, is it all right?

07:29.610 --> 07:31.550
Just leave him like that.

07:31.550 --> 07:35.220
So why are you guys here?
Are you also on a job?

07:35.220 --> 07:36.990
No, it's a present.

07:37.550 --> 07:38.820
Present?

07:38.820 --> 07:39.760
Yes.

07:39.760 --> 07:43.790
To replenish our energy,
Master Kaoru gave us a trip to hot springs.

07:43.790 --> 07:45.830
We take turns taking breaks.

07:45.830 --> 07:47.860
Master Kaoru is so kind.

07:47.860 --> 07:50.500
Indeed. He's a wonderful master.

07:50.930 --> 07:54.340
To be able to work under the kind Master Kaoru,

07:54.340 --> 07:56.240
is an Inukami's dream.

07:57.910 --> 08:01.780
Nadeshiko, I'll wash your back.

08:01.780 --> 08:03.180
You're so smooth.

08:03.180 --> 08:06.010
You're pretty muscular.

08:07.050 --> 08:10.020
I can't see, and it's making me more excited.

08:10.020 --> 08:11.950
You better remember this.

08:14.520 --> 08:15.760
Yoko?

08:19.030 --> 08:20.460
I'm free?

08:21.960 --> 08:23.230
So this is her plan.

08:34.880 --> 08:36.710
She would go this far?

08:36.710 --> 08:42.350
Yoko! Cut it out already!

08:36.710 --> 08:38.550
Closed for cleaning

08:42.350 --> 08:44.790
Humph, serves him right.

08:49.860 --> 08:52.560
Why does man climb a hotel?

08:52.560 --> 08:55.260
Because there are no clothes there.

09:02.740 --> 09:03.940
Elephant.

09:03.940 --> 09:05.310
Hi there.

09:05.970 --> 09:07.040
Mommy.

09:16.390 --> 09:19.250
You're doing great, my dear biceps.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.720
It's so hot.

09:22.560 --> 09:23.760
Ouch.

09:26.160 --> 09:27.800
Mommy, elephant again.

09:30.300 --> 09:31.800
Move!

09:33.400 --> 09:35.300
- See?
- Don't look!

09:39.270 --> 09:40.880
This is great.

09:41.140 --> 09:44.110
I don't even need my Teleport.

09:48.250 --> 09:49.650
Who are you?

09:52.450 --> 09:53.590
Show yourself.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.730
What are you?

10:06.200 --> 10:07.540
Made it.

10:08.300 --> 10:10.770
Surely Yoko is satisfied now.

10:12.370 --> 10:13.810
Uh, what?

10:24.090 --> 10:25.950
"Inukami!"

10:26.420 --> 10:27.720
Woof woof.

10:29.260 --> 10:30.860
"Inukami!"

10:33.730 --> 10:36.160
What are you?

10:47.580 --> 10:49.680
Wait. I'll get you!

10:52.350 --> 10:54.680
Please let it be a spade.

10:58.990 --> 11:00.490
Get back here.

11:03.360 --> 11:04.730
Master Keita?

11:07.060 --> 11:08.330
I'll get you.

11:08.660 --> 11:11.800
That's my apron.

11:12.130 --> 11:13.440
Is Keita here?

11:15.540 --> 11:18.070
What's this? What happened?

11:18.070 --> 11:20.210
Wait, you monster.

11:25.180 --> 11:26.580
Darn them.

11:31.020 --> 11:33.660
Oh, um... Excuse me.

11:35.460 --> 11:37.430
This is all Yoko's fault.

11:43.000 --> 11:45.800
If we can't chase him out, we'll use him.

11:45.800 --> 11:49.340
We'll work him to the bone.

11:54.540 --> 11:56.280
My imagination?

12:00.450 --> 12:02.420
Tomekichi the traveling cat?

12:02.420 --> 12:03.390
Yes.

12:03.620 --> 12:06.220
In place of a kind priest, for generations,

12:06.220 --> 12:10.460
we have searched for Buddha statues scattered all over.

12:10.460 --> 12:12.030
How loyal of you.

12:12.030 --> 12:14.400
And that Buddha is in this hotel?

12:14.400 --> 12:18.630
Apparently, the old owner of this land buried it somewhere.

12:18.900 --> 12:22.470
But unfortunately, the map is old and incomplete.

12:22.970 --> 12:25.010
This gives no info.

12:25.810 --> 12:27.740
Master Keita is still gone.

12:29.040 --> 12:32.250
It's for not massaging, trimming, and brushing me.

12:32.250 --> 12:33.620
Massaging?

12:33.620 --> 12:34.680
Trimming?

12:34.680 --> 12:36.120
Brushing?

12:36.650 --> 12:38.720
You guys sure have it nice.

12:38.720 --> 12:40.760
You have a nice master.

12:40.760 --> 12:42.760
That's not the case.

12:42.760 --> 12:44.460
Even Master Keita is...

12:46.530 --> 12:47.900
Whoa, incredible.

12:47.900 --> 12:50.830
A nail clipper, brush, and massager all in one.

12:51.700 --> 12:52.670
Unbelievable.

12:53.940 --> 12:57.370
Massage, trim, and brush, huh?

13:05.610 --> 13:06.950
Keita.

13:08.550 --> 13:10.590
Massage, trim, and brush.

13:10.920 --> 13:13.390
Massage, trim, and brush.

13:15.620 --> 13:16.760
Nicely done.

13:17.160 --> 13:19.430
It's way too good for Keita.

13:20.230 --> 13:21.730
So you were here.

13:21.930 --> 13:23.870
This is bad. Mr. Kawahira is...

13:27.570 --> 13:28.470
Keita!

13:29.540 --> 13:33.580
I'm digging up the things I like.

13:34.540 --> 13:35.480
Gold.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.110
Diggity dig.

13:37.910 --> 13:39.210
Women.

13:39.610 --> 13:40.950
Diggity dig.

13:41.620 --> 13:42.720
Food.

13:46.690 --> 13:48.990
A hundred million yen coin.

13:51.130 --> 13:56.830
I'm covered in celebrity swimsuit pictures.

14:08.580 --> 14:09.410
Delicious.

14:10.680 --> 14:11.910
What's with him?

14:13.950 --> 14:15.280
Off you go.

14:15.980 --> 14:19.860
It seems that those demons are making him hallucinate.

14:19.860 --> 14:22.920
Then I'll pull them away with Teleport.

14:23.360 --> 14:24.330
Teleport.

14:27.530 --> 14:28.630
One more.

14:29.330 --> 14:30.500
So fast.

14:30.500 --> 14:31.600
You see that?

14:31.600 --> 14:33.840
You'll never get us.

14:33.840 --> 14:36.270
Come on, dig.

14:36.270 --> 14:38.770
Is somebody there?

14:39.910 --> 14:41.810
Awesome. It's a jewel.

14:41.810 --> 14:43.850
Keita, cut it out!

14:50.420 --> 14:51.720
I found oil.

14:53.890 --> 14:55.490
Keita.

14:58.230 --> 15:01.960
Awesome, a yet to be released
Jump magazine!

15:01.960 --> 15:04.970
I'll be a hero at school tomorrow.

15:05.570 --> 15:08.840
I mean, the preview is different every week.

15:08.840 --> 15:10.810
I'm so curious.

15:10.810 --> 15:12.270
Keita.

15:20.980 --> 15:22.180
This is...

15:26.720 --> 15:29.220
Massager, nail clipper,

15:30.130 --> 15:30.990
and brush.

15:30.990 --> 15:33.460
That's right. Please remember!

15:33.460 --> 15:35.300
What's going on?

15:35.300 --> 15:39.970
Perhaps that thing ties them together.

15:40.170 --> 15:44.570
She's trying to take Master Keita back from the illusions.

15:45.170 --> 15:48.710
Feelings overcome illusions.

15:50.080 --> 15:51.250
Darn it.

15:51.250 --> 15:54.720
Massage, trim, and brush.

15:59.220 --> 16:00.190
Keita!

16:02.560 --> 16:05.260
I'm a fool for just buying this.

16:05.860 --> 16:08.660
This is too stupid. I don't need it.

16:09.300 --> 16:10.700
Good going.

16:10.700 --> 16:13.130
Let's continue digging.

16:22.180 --> 16:25.050
Those who toy with a maiden's heart...

16:25.050 --> 16:28.250
will be burned by fire and wake up!

16:28.250 --> 16:29.720
Evil Fire!

16:35.560 --> 16:38.530
Geez, I went through some rough things.

16:38.530 --> 16:40.460
We're sorry.

16:40.460 --> 16:43.160
What is going on?
Tell us your reason.

16:43.570 --> 16:47.640
Okay. We used to be the owners of this land.

16:47.640 --> 16:50.170
Yes. Including that hotel area.

16:51.010 --> 16:54.840
We had to let go of our land due to gambling debts.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.780
We ended up penniless.

16:56.780 --> 16:59.780
But one day, we remembered.

16:59.780 --> 17:03.620
That we once buried a treasure when we were prosperous.

17:03.620 --> 17:06.220
We can't rest in peace until we find it.

17:06.220 --> 17:07.660
We can't die like this.

17:08.160 --> 17:12.630
They were attached, and turned into demons after that.

17:12.630 --> 17:14.430
What a selfish story.

17:14.430 --> 17:16.830
We have the right to be so!

17:17.070 --> 17:19.270
We won't get paid at this rate.

17:19.270 --> 17:22.870
Umm, was there a Buddha among the treasure?

17:23.440 --> 17:24.710
Buddha?

17:24.940 --> 17:27.140
I think there was.

17:27.140 --> 17:28.680
Do you have a map?

17:28.680 --> 17:32.350
We do, but it's incomplete and useless.

17:48.430 --> 17:50.570
It should be beyond here.

17:56.600 --> 17:58.210
All right, here I go.

18:00.280 --> 18:01.440
Teleport.

18:14.660 --> 18:15.760
There's no mistake.

18:15.760 --> 18:17.630
It's the treasure.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.700
The Buddha.

18:39.450 --> 18:40.880
Mr. Keita.

18:48.260 --> 18:49.820
I'm so glad.

18:50.230 --> 18:52.230
That sure looks ancient.

18:52.230 --> 18:54.330
I thought it'd be golden.

18:54.330 --> 18:56.460
Don't judge by its looks.

18:56.460 --> 18:59.970
For him, this old
Buddha statue is a treasure.

19:00.600 --> 19:01.800
Mr. Keita.

19:02.470 --> 19:03.170
Right?

19:03.170 --> 19:05.610
Yes, thank you so much.

19:05.610 --> 19:07.040
For me,

19:07.510 --> 19:09.380
this is a national treasure.

19:12.780 --> 19:15.550
Mr. Keita is a wonderful person.

19:16.320 --> 19:20.020
Don't judge by looks.
Not many people can say that.

19:20.860 --> 19:23.660
Just like this Buddha,

19:23.660 --> 19:26.930
I can feel wonderfulness brimming from inside him.

19:26.930 --> 19:28.700
Is that so.

19:28.700 --> 19:30.870
You have a wonderful master.

19:32.300 --> 19:34.400
You're absolutely correct!

19:34.400 --> 19:36.910
He's perverted and messy,

19:36.910 --> 19:39.740
but he gets the job done.

19:39.740 --> 19:42.010
This is amazing.

19:42.580 --> 19:44.050
Money!

19:44.880 --> 19:48.120
Golds and silver, tons of them.

19:48.120 --> 19:52.190
The most important thing in the world is money!

19:52.190 --> 19:54.560
That's right!

19:52.190 --> 19:54.560
Money King

19:54.560 --> 19:56.760
Mr. Keita.

19:56.760 --> 19:58.090
Keita.

20:00.230 --> 20:04.930
Super Huge Teleport!

20:12.210 --> 20:16.040
We'll use this as funds and retake everything!

20:16.040 --> 20:19.750
Poker, blackjack, roulette!

20:20.150 --> 20:24.090
It's burning!

20:24.090 --> 20:29.590
Purify your greed-corrupted body with a hot spring bath!

20:30.530 --> 20:32.860
Flooded hot spring

20:34.330 --> 20:36.460
Oh, that hurts.

20:36.460 --> 20:38.500
But it feels good.

20:38.500 --> 20:40.670
How's that, can you feel it?

20:40.670 --> 20:43.540
It feels nice. Do more.

20:43.540 --> 20:45.510
It's a nice pain, no?

20:46.980 --> 20:48.510
That's the spot.

20:49.010 --> 20:51.280
After this, it's nail clipping.

20:52.250 --> 20:53.450
Yes.

20:54.380 --> 20:56.280
You're oddly nice today.

20:56.280 --> 20:57.490
Really?

20:59.250 --> 21:00.520
I get it.

21:00.520 --> 21:03.930
You do care about massaging, trimming, and brushing me.

21:03.930 --> 21:06.030
I told you that's not it.

21:06.030 --> 21:08.230
You're so dishonest.

21:09.160 --> 21:10.500
Thank you, Keita.

21:14.300 --> 21:15.170
Stab!

21:16.840 --> 21:18.370
What pressure point is that?

21:18.370 --> 21:20.240
It makes you into a nice lady.

21:20.240 --> 21:21.480
Seriously?

21:21.480 --> 21:22.980
- Nope.
- It hurts!

21:22.980 --> 21:24.950
Don't struggle. Ouch!

21:37.690 --> 21:42.960
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

21:42.960 --> 21:48.370
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

21:48.370 --> 21:53.540
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

21:53.540 --> 21:58.710
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

21:59.350 --> 22:01.920
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

22:01.920 --> 22:04.520
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

22:04.520 --> 22:07.120
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

22:07.120 --> 22:10.490
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

22:10.990 --> 22:13.530
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

22:13.530 --> 22:16.230
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

22:16.230 --> 22:21.500
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

22:21.500 --> 22:23.970
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

22:23.970 --> 22:26.640
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

22:26.640 --> 22:32.750
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

22:33.180 --> 22:35.580
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Let's fight</i>

22:35.580 --> 22:38.220
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

22:38.220 --> 22:41.690
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

22:51.030 --> 22:53.940
Inukami!

22:53.940 --> 22:54.900
See you

22:54.970 --> 22:57.870
Next episode preview

22:55.840 --> 23:00.810
Scrubbing your body with a dry towel stimulates autonomic nerves.

23:01.080 --> 23:05.210
On cold mornings, scrub your body until it turns red.

23:05.210 --> 23:06.080
It's cold.

23:06.550 --> 23:11.750
But as you overcome that, you will truly become healthy.

23:12.190 --> 23:16.160
The path to a healthy body is a very harsh road.

23:16.560 --> 23:18.130
Next on Inukami.

23:18.130 --> 23:19.660
"Rub the Tail!"

23:19.930 --> 23:24.500
Not just three and a half times, rub everything as much as you want.

23:19.930 --> 23:24.930
Rub the Tail!
